    skos:prefLabel "Heap"@en ;
    emmo:elucidation "The superclass for all classes of entities that have at least two non overlapping proper parts of the same type of the whole."@en ;
    emmo:illustration "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/emmo-repo/EMMO/1.0.2/doc/figs/Heap.png"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    emmo:note "A heap class H (subclass of Heap) is defined by choosing a reference type φ, with H subclass of φ, so that each H entity has non overlapping φ parts."@en .

