    owl:annotatedTarget emmo:EMMO_e7aac247_31d6_4b2e_9fd2_e842b1b7ccac ;
    emmo:conceptualisation """This axiom reflects the fact the the universe is causally self-connected. In fact, a  non causally connected universe would have been the sum of causally independend sub-universes, without any knowledge of others.
This axiom may be seen as Ockam's razor applied to causality."""@en .

